OL,3,GNEWSACambridge professor lifts world
OL,4,Atiddlywinks crown
OL,5,
OL,6,FA professor at the University of
OL,7,FCambridge has flicked the competition
OL,8,Faside in a high-stakes game of
OL,9,Ftiddlywinks to retain his coveted world
OL,10,Ftitle.
OL,12,FTiddlywinks is a game in which players
OL,13,Ftry to get small plastic discs into a
OL,14,Fcup by pressing one piece against
OL,15,Fanother to make it fly through the air.
OL,17,FIt can be traced back to Victorian
OL,18,Ftimes, but the birth of the modern game
OL,19,Fstems from a group of Cambridge
OL,20,Fundergraduates meeting in Christ's
OL,21,FCollege in 1955, the English
OL,22,FTiddlywinks Association said.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
