OL,3,GNEWSACambridge professor lifts world
OL,4,Atiddlywinks crown
OL,5,
OL,6,FProf Patrick Barrie, 61, won the World
OL,7,FSingles Tiddlywinks Championships on
OL,8,FThursday, beating Dave Lockwood of the
OL,9,FUS in a seven-hour match held at the
OL,10,FCastle Inn pub in Cambridge.
